  "description": "The Innokin GO S MTL Starter Kit is an innovative fusion of pen-style vape kit and refillable, replaceable tank device. It also happens to look super-stylish, feels amazing in the hand thanks to solid, quality materials and boasts great all-day use thanks to an impressive 1500mAh battery. Designed for a superb mouth to lung (MTL) vape experience, the GO S novel replaceable tanks. Made from food grade PCTG plastic, the pod features an adjustable airflow to help you home in your preferred draw. The pod comprises a specially designed 1.6 ohm coil made wicked with organic cotton and wood pulp, which together provide astonishing flavour. When the coil reaches the end of its life it’s just a matter of replacing it. Simple to fill, the GO S incorporates a nifty slide-to-open system that makes refilling the tank a fuss-free breeze. Check out our vape fluid and pair it seamlessly with this kit. The Innokin GO S MTL kit works best with classic High PG, 50/50 or nicotine salts e-liquids. With single-button operation, the Innokin Go S MTL starter kit is a wonder of convenience, performance and incredible flavour.",
